  "scenes": [
    {
      "text": "What if Rock Lee woke up with the Rinnegan? The character creator just lost its damn mind completely.",
      "label": "THE BUILD IS ILLEGAL",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.86745884916498,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-lee",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rock Lee moving through taijutsu; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a fan-made upgrade, not canon. Lee gets gravity powers before he gets an instruction manual. Excellent parenting, universe.",
      "label": "HYPOTHETICAL UPGRADE",
      "start": 4.86745884916498,
      "end": 11.945840907985884,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-eye",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rinnegan reference for the hypothetical borrowed eye ability; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-eye",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rinnegan reference for the hypothetical borrowed eye ability; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He tries a normal warm-up. The training weights fly toward his face. Brother ordered express shipping on his own concussion.",
      "label": "THE FIRST ACCIDENT",
      "start": 11.945840907985884,
      "end": 18.013025529832372,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-train",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Lee training with physical discipline; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guy says the power of youth requires control. Sir, your student just magnetized the furniture. Start with eye safety.",
      "label": "GUY HAS CONCERNS",
      "start": 18.013025529832372,
      "end": 24.37157212504437,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-guy",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Might Guy encouraging Lee; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-guy",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Might Guy encouraging Lee; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-guy",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Might Guy encouraging Lee; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Having the eyes wouldn't instantly teach every technique. Chakra demand and concentration still matter. Premium hardware, zero installed drivers.",
      "label": "EYES ARE NOT A TUTORIAL",
      "start": 24.37157212504437,
      "end": 32.20406752669365,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-eye",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rinnegan reference for the hypothetical borrowed eye ability; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-eye",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rinnegan reference for the hypothetical borrowed eye ability; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-eye",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rinnegan reference for the hypothetical borrowed eye ability; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lee experiments with pulling opponents off balance before a kick. Strong idea. Horrific first day for the practice dummy.",
      "label": "KICKS WITH CONSEQUENCES",
      "start": 32.20406752669365,
      "end": 38.322668967369346,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-lee",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rock Lee moving through taijutsu; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then he realizes the harder lesson: when teammates stand nearby, a wild push can hurt the people he's protecting.",
      "label": "THE RESTRAINT TEST",
      "start": 38.322668967369346,
      "end": 44.047074797021125,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-train",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Lee training with physical discipline; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So Guy sets a challenge. Move one falling leaf with the new power. Not the tree. Not the neighborhood.",
      "label": "THAT IS THE REAL TRAINING",
      "start": 44.047074797021125,
      "end": 49.10306198189319,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-guy",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Might Guy encouraging Lee; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-guy",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Might Guy encouraging Lee; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lee struggles because precision doesn't care how inspirational your speech sounds. The leaf remains deeply unimpressed by his grindset.",
      "label": "ONE LEAF BRO",
      "start": 49.10306198189319,
      "end": 55.75297055047071,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-eye",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rinnegan reference for the hypothetical borrowed eye ability; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-eye",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rinnegan reference for the hypothetical borrowed eye ability; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He stops chasing the biggest attack and uses tiny pulls to create openings. The punches finally have a group chat.",
      "label": "NO MAXIMUM POWER COMBO",
      "start": 55.75297055047071,
      "end": 61.92298880997561,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-lee",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Rock Lee moving through taijutsu; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When a teammate falls, Lee catches them with controlled force instead of flexing. That rescue is the actual upgrade here.",
      "label": "THE RESCUE MATTERS",
      "start": 61.92298880997561,
      "end": 68.00731237143184,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-rock-lee-rinnegan-01-train",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Lee training with physical discipline; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guy cries with pride. Lee cries too. The leaf floats perfectly. Three episodes of training, and the final boss was landscaping.",
